# Copy to ~/.config/server-link/ports   (laptop side)
# One port per line. Each one is forwarded laptop 127.0.0.1:PORT -> server 127.0.0.1:PORT.
# Text after the number is a comment. The port must be FREE on the laptop (stop the laptop copy of the service first).
7800 status screen (server-now API)
8000 example: a web app that moved to the server
